*Description of changes:*
This PR introduce an utility to create DataStore-compatible predicates from an object representation.

Turns:
```js
{
  and: [
    {
       field: "name",
       operator: "beginsWith",
       operand: "John"
     },
     {
       field: "age",
       operator: "gt",
       operand: "25"
     }
  ]
}
```

Into:
```ts
p => p.and(
   p => p.name("contains", "John").age("gt", "25")
)
```


